// wj-sync — idiomatic Windjammer concurrency (Go-style sync + CSP channels).
// Public surface: Channel, Shared, Pending, Pool — never Arc/Mutex/async/spawn.
// Generics-first (2026-09-16 design); int instantiations are type aliases (`SharedInt`, `IntReceiver`, ...).

